entries.body:
Drawn in the book's figure language (harbor-chartwork gates clean in all three
editions) and placed beside the passages they explain:
- one rule, three checkpoints (prompt, write gate, review), Chapter 0;
- the five assurance modes for one write, Chapter 1;
- the blame set by deletion and when escalation has a next hop, Chapter 4;
- processes come and go while the account stays, Chapter 5;
- three exchange rates that multiply to 1.2 around a loop, Chapter 6.
The escalation caption no longer gives away its exercise's answer.
